_parsedApps[id] = app;         // healthy truth
final listed = missingEntry == null ? app : app.withError(missingEntry);
if (listed.supportsPlatform(platform)) apps.add(listed);
```

And the cached branch:
```dart
if (cached != null && hashes match && missingEntry == null && refs unchanged) {
  if (cached.supportsPlatform(platform)) apps.add(cached);
  continue;
}
```
→ when missingEntry != null we re-parse (fresh path) and re-cache the healthy parse. ✓.

