    '${entryPath(id, entry)} is missing or unreadable. '
    'Reinstall the app from the widgets catalog or ask Fa to recreate it.';
```

Hmm — AppStorage producing UI copy? Keep messages in AppsStore instead; AppStorage stays pure-resolution. I'll put `missingEntryMessage` in AppsStore as a static (visibleForTesting not needed; static public for tests).

